; Work: is ports/turbouae/work on the SD card - put files here from the PC.
; The Workbench hardfile runs this script at boot (Execute Work:run).
;
; xSysInfo (Work:xSysInfo, 2026) needs identify.library, which lives in Work:Libs.
Assign LIBS: Work:Libs ADD
; Xtreme Racing (second hardfile, volume XtremeRacing:) keeps Takeover.library on its disk
Assign >NIL: LIBS: XtremeRacing: ADD
;
; First boot with the RTG board: put the Workbench screen on it (640x480, 256 colours),
; once - afterwards ScreenMode prefs is yours. rtgmode does nothing if RTG is off.
If NOT EXISTS Work:rtgmode.done
  Work:rtgmode 640 480 8
  If NOT WARN
    Echo >Work:rtgmode.done "screen mode set"
  EndIf
EndIf
